Package: ggrewindr
Title: Late 90s Themes for ggplot2
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Martin", "Frigaard", email = "mjfrigaard@pm.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of 'ggplot2' themes inspired by late 1990s toys,
    snacks, TV shows, and technology. Each palette is sampled from a freely
    licensed image of its reference and checked for contrast and color blind
    separation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports: 
    ggplot2 (>= 4.0.0),
    sysfonts
Suggests: 
    knitr,
    showtext,
    quarto,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://mjfrigaard.github.io/ggrewindr/, https://github.com/mjfrigaard/ggrewindr
BugReports: https://github.com/mjfrigaard/ggrewindr/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
